   125	// ---- Scheduled pauses & the Sawyer reminder ----
   126	
   127	// A pause scheduled by completing the Pause checklist has scheduledAt; a Quick Log request
   128	// (loggedAt only) hasn't been checked for eligibility yet and must be processed by hand.
   129	function isProcessedScheduledPause(sp) {
