   162	// Pipeline "Pause Scheduled" column: an Active member whose scheduled pause starts after today
   163	// (processed or a Quick Log request — both show the badge). On the start day they're back
   164	// under Active until the page-load check moves them to Paused. Board display only.
   165	function hasUpcomingPause(member, today) {
